&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-865094-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. If applicable, have a link here to the specific entry on the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
