					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div id="wiki-tabview-e093aec3aa24b4ac0e15a306ce4659e5" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Profile</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Contributions</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Plans</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Favourites</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;"> <p>Hey, I'm <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606680456" alt="Sirslash47" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" >Sirslash47</a></span>. Often also called Sirslash or Slash.</p> <p>I first came into contact with the SCP-wiki a few years ago. Most likely somewhere between 2012-2014 but perhaps even sooner. I'd say somewhere in 2012 but I wouldn't bet on it. After 2014 I definitely knew what the wiki was. I kind of had an on-off thing where I remembered it and forgot it again.</p> <p>I joined in May 2020 because I remembered that I could actually apply. I actually could have joined years sooner. But I'm glad that I'm here now. I see myself as a mediocre member of the wiki and user of the chat.</p> <p>I hope I can build towards others their experience here in general. Thank you, for checking out my author page.</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h1><span style="color: #000;"><span>SCP's</span></span></h1> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5147">SCP-5147</a> &quot;The Mannequin Troupe&quot;</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5927">SCP-5927</